  + /// Parsed `/extended` arguments.
  + ///
  + /// `explicit_turns` is deliberately a *third state* separate from `turns`:
  + /// `None` means "the user did not ask for a turn cap", which is not the same as
  + /// "the user asked for the default". The difference is load-bearing — we only
  + /// tighten the agent's real `ExecutionLimits` when a cap was actually requested,
  + /// so the documented default (20) stays advisory prompt text and we never
  + /// silently shrink an existing session's limits.
